  "rawText": "Item Class: Life Flasks\nRarity: Magic\nSeething Divine Life Flask of Staunching\n--------\nQuality: +20% (augmented)\nRecovers 3360 (augmented) Life over 7.00 Seconds\nConsumes 15 of 45 Charges on use\nCurrently has 45 Charges\n--------\nRequirements:\nLevel: 60\n--------\nItem Level: 84\n--------\n{ Prefix Modifier \"Seething\" (Tier: 1) — Life }\n66% reduced Amount Recovered\nInstant Recovery\n{ Suffix Modifier \"of Staunching\" — Bleeding }\nGrants Immunity to Bleeding for 9(6-9) seconds if used while Bleeding\nGrants Immunity to Corrupted Blood for 9(6-9) seconds if used while affected by Corrupted Blood\n--------\nRight click to drink. Can only hold charges while in belt. Refills as you kill monsters.\n",
